[{"type":"message","user":"U01GH1TRL7N","text":"\u003c@U01GH1TRL7N\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1627264022.229000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3f27b5c9-94c8-4c1e-bceb-12d6ff3bf5c5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ほころびさんがやってる、毎週1回泳ぐのだって慣れてない人だとしんどいすよね。水泳は全身運動だし、結構疲れる。","ts":"1627226659.228500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xXe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"416bcbb1-9aad-4502-bb7f-576341975dba","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"まぁ毎日どら焼き1個食べる訳じゃないし、たまに食べたらたまに歩くというのは理にかなってるかも。","ts":"1627226599.227900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AM5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d434122-4ef6-45fa-b22f-d8f5222e1dc4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"継続がしんどいんですよね。たまに50分歩くのは気分転換になるし負担も感じない。","ts":"1627226555.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wepmI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c064dbc5-c830-451f-a7e2-aaa16dbb24e8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"今日炎天下で1時間ちょい歩いたけど、普段歩かない(かつ、迷いようがない)場所だったから、割と楽しかった","ts":"1627226213.226400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Tso"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab1a2b29-d853-4a8c-b678-d1119aad4953","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"歩くのが目的で歩くとなると辛いですね。通勤があれば、相当分は消費してそう。","ts":"1627225986.225400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qVqH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc603eba-1672-4a57-a4a0-d1a450d52be6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"50分歩くのって苦痛と思う人が多そう","ts":"1627225560.224600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"psIm/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4be8d4a6-7892-46d4-a9fa-abab774a4746","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"漫然と走るよりは、むしろ楽しめそうですけどね。 \u0026gt; 探す努力","ts":"1627225238.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OHJE"}]}]
